# Secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
!**/.env.example
!.env.shared.example

# Runtime state lives outside the repo (see .env.shared DOCKER_DATA).
# Only local scratch files are ignored here:
**/.DS_Store
**/logs/

# Generated Hugo output
stacks/hugo/site/public/
stacks/hugo/site/resources/_gen/

# SearXNG generated config (contains secret_key) - use .example as template
stacks/searxng/config/settings.yml

# Local agent scratch docs (kept out of the repo)
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md
